Chapter: WorkflowExporterMain
  cites Explorer chapter WorkflowExporter
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 The bootable entry point for the workflow exporter page. It lives in its
 own chapter, apart from the WorkflowExporter library, so a program can cite
 WorkflowExporter for its build-*-workflow helpers (as ExplorerServer does)
 without inheriting a second `opening`. This is the same split as
 ErpServer / ErpServerMain.

Section: Entry Point

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">"
    print-line-uni "<title>CodexMagic -- Workflow Exporter</title>"
    print-line-uni "<style>"
    print-line-uni explorer-css
    print-line-uni workflow-css
    print-line-uni "</style></head><body>"
    print-line-uni workflow-page-html
    print-line-uni "<script>"
    print-line-uni workflow-js
    print-line-uni "</script>"
    print-line-uni "</body></html>"
  end
